1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,850
Is a recovery agent knocking on your door?

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:03,870
One minute…

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,820
Don't open the door at all!

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,200
Know the biggest mistake people make out of fear?

5
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:12,570
Panicking and letting him in while he shouts outside!

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:16,710
No rule says you must let anyone in without your permission.

7
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:21,560
However loud he gets, stop him at the door and ask just two things:

8
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:22,440
Number one:

9
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,840
Show me your official bank ID card.

10
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:25,870
Number two:

11
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:29,890
Where is the written authorization letter the bank gave for my account?

12
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:31,430
Trust me…

13
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:35,790
90% of local agents simply won't have this letter!

14
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,300
And most important:

15
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:39,860
Don't hand anyone even one rupee in cash.

16
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,740
Don't sign any paper.

17
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,390
If he tries to threaten you?

18
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:44,840
Don't argue at all.

19
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:47,970
Just pick up the phone and call 112.

20
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,580
But under the actual RBI rules,

21
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,880
how do you legally silence them?

22
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:56,150
How do you put a permanent full stop to recovery calls?

23
00:00:56,240 --> 00:01:01,230
I've shown the complete process step by step in the full video on our channel.

24
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:04,490
Click the link below right now and watch the full video.

25
